---
// Amiya Health project detail
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Amiya Health - Maverick Huynh</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <nav class="nav">
      <span class="nav-text">
        Sophomore at USC based in Los Angeles /
        <a href="/" class="nav-link">home</a> /
        Amiya Health
      </span>
    </nav>

    <main class="project-page">
      <a href="/#projects" class="back-link">← Projects</a>

      <header class="project-header">
        <div class="project-header-top">
          <h1 class="project-title">Amiya Health</h1>
          <span class="project-date">a16z Hackathon</span>
        </div>
        <div class="project-intro">
          <p>
            Amiya Health is an AI-powered virtual checkup platform built to make telehealth more accessible for seniors. It was my first hackathon project, created with a team at an a16z hackathon, and it pushed me to think about product design for people who are often left out of digital healthcare tools.
          </p>
          <p>
            Instead of assuming everyone is comfortable with apps and interfaces, we focused on a simpler checkup experience: guided questions, clearer language, and a flow that feels supportive rather than overwhelming. The goal was to help older adults get useful health insight without needing to navigate a complicated telehealth system.
          </p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <section class="project-meta glass-panel">
        <div class="meta-row">
          <span class="meta-label">Role</span>
          <span class="meta-value">Hackathon Builder | Front End Developer</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-row">
          <span class="meta-label">Partner</span>
          <span class="meta-value">a16z Hackathon</span>
        </div>
        <div class="meta-row">
          <span class="meta-label">Type</span>
          <span class="meta-value">Healthcare · Hackathon</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="project-section glass-panel">
        <div class="section-logo">
          <img src="/images/A16z-Emblem.png" alt="a16z" />
        </div>
        <h2 class="section-title">What we built</h2>
        <p>
          We designed Amiya Health as a virtual checkup platform that uses AI to guide users through health questions and surface useful next steps. The product focus was accessibility: fewer confusing screens, clearer prompts, and an experience that seniors could actually use.
        </p>
        <p>
          Working under hackathon constraints meant moving fast, making tradeoffs, and shipping something real. I learned how to turn a healthcare problem into a product concept, then into a working demo that could communicate the idea clearly.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="project-section glass-panel resources-panel">
        <h2 class="section-title">Links</h2>
        <div class="resource-links">
          <a
            class="resource-link"
            href="https://github.com/royli25/amiyahealth"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            <span class="resource-link-label">GitHub</span>
            <span class="resource-link-meta">View code</span>
          </a>
          <a
            class="resource-link"
            href="#"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            <span class="resource-link-label">Demo video</span>
            <span class="resource-link-meta">Watch</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style is:global>

  html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  html,
  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 100%;
    min-height: 100vh;
    font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    color: #1d1d1f;
    background-color: #f5f5f7;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  body {
    opacity: 0;
    animation: pageFadeIn 0.3s ease forwards;
  }

  @keyframes pageFadeIn {
    from { opacity: 0; }
    to { opacity: 1; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    body {
      opacity: 1;
      animation: none;
    }
  }

  *,
  *::before,
  *::after {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .nav {
    position: fixed;
    top: 1rem;
    left: 2rem;
    right: 2.5rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    z-index: 100;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    backdrop-filter: blur(28px) saturate(180%);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(28px) saturate(180%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
  }

  .nav-text {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #111;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .nav-link {
    color: #111;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .nav-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .project-page {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 920px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 7.5rem 2rem 4rem 2rem;
  }

  .project-page::before,
  .project-page::after {
    display: none;
  }

  .back-link,
  .project-header,
  .project-meta,
  .project-section,
  .project-photo {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #6e6e73;
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: #1d1d1f;
  }

  .project-header-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .project-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.25rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: #1d1d1f;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .project-date {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #6e6e73;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .project-intro p {
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #3a3a3c;
    max-width: 46em;
  }

  .project-intro p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .project-intro strong {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #1d1d1f;
  }

  .glass-panel {
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
    padding: 1.5rem 1.6rem;
    border-radius: 1.5rem;
    background: linear-gradient(
      155deg,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28) 0%,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) 45%,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16) 100%
    );
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(160%);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(160%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
    box-shadow:
      0 10px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75),
      inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  }

  .project-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }

  .project-photo {
    margin: 1.75rem 0 0 0;
    padding: 0.85rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .project-photo img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-height: 420px;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 30%;
    border-radius: 1.1rem;
    display: block;
  }

  .project-photo-caption {
    margin: 0.85rem 0.35rem 0.35rem 0.35rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: #1d1d1f;
  }

  .meta-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 7rem 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: baseline;
  }

  .meta-label {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #86868b;
  }

  .meta-value {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #1d1d1f;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .section-logo {
    width: 72px;
    height: 72px;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .section-logo img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-width: 72px;
    max-height: 72px;
    object-fit: contain;
    display: block;
  }

  .section-title {
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem 0;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: #1d1d1f;
  }

  .project-section p {
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #3a3a3c;
  }

  .project-section p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .resources-panel .resource-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
  }

  .resource-link {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.15rem;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #1d1d1f;
    background: linear-gradient(
      155deg,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28) 0%,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) 45%,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16) 100%
    );
    backdrop-filter: blur(40px) saturate(200%);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(40px) saturate(200%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
    box-shadow:
      0 10px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75),
      inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2),
      inset 1px 0 20px rgba(180, 210, 255, 0.12),
      inset -1px 0 20px rgba(230, 190, 255, 0.1);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  .resource-link:hover {
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow:
      0 14px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85),
      inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25),
      inset 1px 0 20px rgba(180, 210, 255, 0.14),
      inset -1px 0 20px rgba(230, 190, 255, 0.12);
  }

  .resource-link-label {
    font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .resource-link-meta {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: #6e6e73;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .nav {
      left: 1rem;
      right: 1rem;
      padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
    }

    .nav-text {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
    }

    .project-page {
      padding: 6.5rem 1.25rem 3rem 1.25rem;
    }

    .project-header-top {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .meta-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.25rem;
    }

    .glass-panel {
      padding: 1.25rem 1.15rem;
      border-radius: 1.25rem;
    }
  }
</style>
